y_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Describing People ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can describe a person's appearance (the way they look).", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "He is well-dressed and short. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When you describe someone's appearance, you talk about their: <ul><li>hair, face, skin and complexion<br> You can use these words: <span class=\"italic\">straight/wavy/curly hair, bald, beard, moustache, fair, light, dark, pale, blonde, brown, black, red</span><li> height and build<br> You can use these words: <span class=\"italic\">tall, short, thin, skinny, overweight, heavyset, muscular </span></li> <li>general appearance<br>  You can use these words: <span class=\"italic\">beautiful, well-dressed, handsome, messy, young, old</span>  </li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "She has light skin and black hair.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to fall asleep ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to begin to sleep ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can't fall asleep tonight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to describe people. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "I'm all ears! ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "used to tell someone they have your attention ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm all ears! Tell me your story.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "creepy ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "making you feel frightened  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That sounds creepy!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to wander", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to walk slowly across or around an area ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The ghost wanders around the towers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to arrest", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to take to a police station because the police think you have done something illegal ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: She was arrested for trying to kill him.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to haunt ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to appear as a ghost in a place repeatedly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: It haunts the towers of the Kremlin.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pale ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having a skin colour that is very white", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: She was a pale-faced woman.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "unkempt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not cared for or neat ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Her hair was unkempt.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to tremble ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to shake slightly ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She looks like she is trembling.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob03aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Read the story that Sally shares with Vanessa.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the same description of the woman but this time, write your own story.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 7-8 lines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your story aloud to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to their story.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I can describe people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I can tell a story.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I can listen to a story.", "type"